OL,3,GNEWSAMen guilty of 'Good Samaritan'
OL,4,Akilling after retrial
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been found guilty of
OL,7,Fkilling a "Good Samaritan" when he
OL,8,Fstepped in to help a 17-year-old girl
OL,9,Fafter she had been assaulted.
OL,11,FReece Radford, 26, was fatally stabbed
OL,12,Fwhen he intervened in the altercation
OL,13,Fin Arundel Gate, Sheffield, in
OL,14,FSeptember 2022.
OL,16,FDereck Owusu and Louis James were
OL,17,Foriginally jailed for life in 2023
OL,18,Fafter being convicted of Radford's
OL,19,Fmurder, but after appealing against
OL,20,Ftheir convictions a retrial was held at
OL,21,FLeeds Crown Court.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
