OL,3,GNEWSAMen guilty of 'Good Samaritan'
OL,4,Akilling after retrial
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday, James, 50, previously of
OL,7,FManor Lane, Sheffield, was found guilty
OL,8,Fof murder, while Owusu, 43, previously
OL,9,Fof Strathmore Grove, Rotherham, was
OL,10,Fconvicted of manslaughter. Both men are
OL,11,Fdue to be re-sentenced on 30 October.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
